> A hand-checkable calculation

Moving right by.5 from0 reaches target.5 with reward0; moving left by.5 gives reward-1. The source fits this direction-plus-magnitude task and separately checks the tanh density against two million samples.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/action_tricks_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
