> Interpretation and provenance

Bounded-mode quality assertions remain explicitly deferred; finite loss/data checks and displayed source comparisons still run. No full convergence or framework-equivalence claim follows from a short run. Original seeds, actual budgets, weak outcomes and final named checkpoints are preserved. Datamunge owns reusable graphs, target algebra and replay data structures; optimizer state, actor scheduling and every experiment loop remain in this editable report.
